# Battle against Koraidon (the Paradox Pokémon of the ancient past): the paradox pair's call (a leap up and a turn
# back to the tonic) roared on brass over pounding toms and timpani in D minor. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Koraidon
tempo 180
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.28

track lead brass lowhp=sawlead vol=0.78 pan=0 rev=0.26
  r1 | o4 d4 a8 o5 c8 d2 |
  L o4 d4 a8 o5 c8 d4. f8 | o5 e4 c4 d2 | o5 a4. g8 f4 d4 | o5 g4. e8 c4 o4 g4 |
